From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Halhadus <eneshakans45@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:23:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/13] ASoC: qcom: audioreach: support voice graph descriptors

Serialize voice subgraph VSIDs, VCPM tags, data connections and control
link intents. Keep per-subgraph module lists when containers are shared
and reject conflicting container descriptions. Preserve non-voice graph
layouts and distinguish parameter sizes from outer alignment padding.

Add typed VCPM setters for session association and AP calibration keys.
Bound topology token indexing independently of hardware port counts.

Signed-off-by: Halhadus <eneshakans45@proton.me>
